OVERVIEW: Generate Average Intensity Projection

USAGE: dicom-3d average <input-paths> ... --output <output> [--direction <direction>] [--window-center <window-center>] [--window-width <window-width>] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input-paths>           Input DICOM files (multi-slice series)

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output file path
  --direction <direction> Projection direction: axial, sagittal, coronal
                          (patient planes, PS3.3 C.7.6.2.1.1) (default: axial)
  --window-center <window-center>
                          Window Center for display (Modality LUT output units,
                          e.g. HU)
  --window-width <window-width>
                          Window Width for display (>= 1, LINEAR function,
                          PS3.3 C.11.2.1.2.1)
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

